#: ../../source/api/reference/data.md:1 d17e5f72574543ab83cc801439336abd
msgid "数据处理"
msgstr "Data processing"

#: ../../source/api/reference/data.md:3 572fb585d3a14755be7fc206bc0f2c19
msgid ""
"模型级数据基类、DataLoader 工厂、windowlate "
"数据集与数据源基类。各数据集处理器（`utils/data_process/<dataset>.py`）均继承 `DataSource`，按需实现"
" `load_src_data` / `clean_raw_data` / `transform_data`。"
msgstr ""
"Model-level data base classes, DataLoader factories, windowlate datasets,"
" and the data source base class. Each dataset handler "
"(`utils/data_process/<dataset>.py`) inherits `DataSource` and implements "
"`load_src_data` / `clean_raw_data` / `transform_data` as needed."

#: ../../source/api/reference/data.md:5 b7c899cbbdf148a6a53ee492b761141c
msgid ""
"`utils.config.DataLoaderConfig` "
"定义加载参数，`utils.model_data.create_optimized_dataloader()` 负责构建 "
"DataLoader。技能级模型通过 `SkillModelData.create_windowlate_dataloader()` 创建 "
"windowlate 加载器，并可通过 `_create_windowlate_dataset()` 扩展模型特有的窗口特征。"
msgstr ""
"`utils.config.DataLoaderConfig` defines loading options, while "
"`utils.model_data.create_optimized_dataloader()` constructs DataLoaders. "
"Skill-level models create windowlate loaders through "
"`SkillModelData.create_windowlate_dataloader()` and can extend model-"
"specific window features through `_create_windowlate_dataset()`."

